abstract: >
  neuroguIA Dataset is an anonymized conversational AI dataset
  designed for socioemotional support research in neurodivergent contexts.
  The dataset includes conversational sessions, contextual memory structures,
  semantic processing signals, adaptive conversational routing, and longitudinal
  interaction data generated through a hybrid NLP and AI architecture.

